OL,3,GNEWSCBBC Breakfast launches new
OL,4,Con-screen graphics
OL,5,
OL,6,FBBC Breakfast introduced a new colour
OL,7,Fscheme, stings and on-screen graphics
OL,8,Fthis morning.
OL,10,FAs revealed on our social media outlets
OL,11,Fearlier this month, the changes mark a
OL,12,Fmove away from Vizrt in favour of
OL,13,FHTML-generated graphics.
OL,15,FA similar technical setup was
OL,16,Fintroduced to Politics Live last
OL,17,Fautumn.
OL,23,EPub: 24-Aug-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
