OL,3,GNEWSCBBC Breakfast launches new
OL,4,Con-screen graphics
OL,5,
OL,6,FBBC Breakfast now has an on-screen
OL,7,Fflipper ` on a coral-to-blue horizontal
OL,8,Fgradient ` providing the main headlines
OL,9,Fand a view of what's coming up later in
OL,10,Fthe programme.
OL,12,FPackages now have single-line
OL,13,Fexplanatory straps ` in white text `
OL,14,Fwhich remain on-screen for the
OL,15,Fpreceding link and for the duration of
OL,16,Fthe package.
OL,18,FThe background of the lower-thirds is a
OL,19,Fpurple gradient scrim.
OL,23,EPub: 24-Aug-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
